  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Fund: Supporting the East Africa Research and Innovation Hub&apos;s participation at the Kenya Innovation Week 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Kenya through the Kenya National Innovation Agency (KeNIA) is organizing and hosting the Kenya Innovation Week between 6-8 December 2022. KIW is a yearly event initiated by the Government of Kenya to pull together stakeholders to improve coordination, synergy and collaboration, to celebrate innovation efforts and to set the ambitions for the subsequent years</narrative>
  </description>
